OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old tortoise recovers
OL,4,Aafter leg amputation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: this article contains images
OL,7,Fsome readers might find upsetting.
OL,9,FA tortoise that is believed to be more
OL,10,Fthan 100 years old is back on the move
OL,11,Fafter undergoing surgery to amputate
OL,12,Fhis leg, following an attack by a wild
OL,13,Fanimal.
OL,15,FTrotter, a Hermann's tortoise, is the
OL,16,Foldest registered patient at his vets
OL,17,Fin Hereford.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
