OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old tortoise recovers
OL,4,Aafter leg amputation
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is believed to have already been a
OL,7,Ffully-grown adult when he trotted into
OL,8,Fthe family's home in 1938, and his
OL,9,Fowner, Gillian Young, believed he might
OL,10,Fhave originally escaped from a delivery
OL,11,Fboat passing through Bristol docks
OL,12,Fbefore making his way into her aunt's
OL,13,Fgarden.
